### 5. 캐싱 패턴 분석

#### 5-1. 현재 캐싱 전략

**파일:** `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/repository/cache/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/repository/cache/config/ValkeyBoostStore.kt`

```kotlin
@Component
class ValkeyBoostStore(
    private val redisTemplate: RedisTemplate<String, String>,
) {
    companion object {
        private const val CATEGORY_BOOST_KEY = "BOOSTKEYWORD:BOOST"
        private const val ATTRIBUTE_BOOST_KEY = "ATTRIBUTEVALUESEQ_BOOSTKEYWORD:BOOST"
    }

    fun getCategoryBoosts(keyword: String): List<CategoryBoostData>? =
        getBoostValue(keyword, CATEGORY_BOOST_KEY)?.let { value ->
            parseCategoryBoosts(value)
        }

    private fun getBoostValue(keyword: String, cacheKey: String): String? =
        runCatching {
            redisTemplate
                .opsForHash<String, String>()
                .get(cacheKey, keyword)
                ?.also { log.debug("Cache HIT [$cacheKey]: '$keyword'") }
                ?: run {
                    log.debug("Cache MISS [$cacheKey]: '$keyword'")
                    null
                }
        }.onFailure { e ->
            log.error("Cache ERROR [$cacheKey]: '$keyword'", e)
        }.getOrNull()
}
```

**특징:**
- Valkey(Redis 호환) Hash 자료구조 사용
- 검색 키워드 기반 BOOST 값 캐싱
- **카테고리 계층 정보 캐싱 없음**

#### 5-2. Valkey 설정

**파일:** `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/repository/cache/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/repository/cache/config/ValkeyConfig.kt`

```kotlin
@Configuration
@EnableConfigurationProperties(ValkeyProperties::class)
class ValkeyConfig(
    private val valkeyProperties: ValkeyProperties,
) {
    @Bean
    fun redisConnectionFactory(): RedisConnectionFactory {
        val clusterConfig = RedisClusterConfiguration(valkeyProperties.hosts)
            .apply {
                setPassword(valkeyProperties.password)
                maxRedirects = valkeyProperties.cluster.maxRedirects
            }

        val clientConfig = LettuceClientConfiguration.builder()
            .commandTimeout(Duration.ofSeconds(valkeyProperties.timeout.commandSeconds))
            .build()

        return LettuceConnectionFactory(clusterConfig, clientConfig)
    }

    @Bean
    fun redisTemplate(connectionFactory: RedisConnectionFactory): RedisTemplate<String, String> =
        RedisTemplate<String, String>().apply {
            this.connectionFactory = connectionFactory
            keySerializer = StringRedisSerializer()
            valueSerializer = StringRedisSerializer()
            // ...
        }
}
```

**특징:**
- Valkey Cluster 지원
- Lettuce 클라이언트 사용
- String 직렬화 (JSON 저장 가능)

